Link LibGfx's direct CoreText calls explicitly and use Nix dependencies
instead of searching the host's Homebrew installation.

Defer bundle signing until postFixup, after Nix has finished modifying it.
Use rcodesign for helper and Cranelift compiler signing during the build.
Provide a default CA bundle to both curl and the RequestServer sandbox
when no certificate file was supplied explicitly.

